{"PageNumber":327,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":58,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَجَعَلَهُمۡ جُذَٰذًا إِلَّا كَبِيرٗا لَّهُمۡ لَعَلَّهُمۡ إِلَيۡهِ يَرۡجِعُونَ","TajweedText":"فَجَعَلَهُمْ جُذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>ذًا إِلَّا كَبِي<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>رًا ل</tajweed>َّهُمْ لَعَلَّهُمْ إِلَيْهِ يَرْجِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٨</span>","End":"٥٨","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":59,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ مَن فَعَلَ هَٰذَا بِـَٔالِهَتِنَآ إِنَّهُۥ لَمِنَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>َعَلَ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا بِـَٔـالِهَتِن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> لَمِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٩</span>","End":"٥٩","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":60,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ سَمِعۡنَا فَتٗى يَذۡكُرُهُمۡ يُقَالُ لَهُۥٓ إِبۡرَٰهِيمُ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> سَمِعْنَا فَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تًى ي</tajweed>َذْكُرُهُمْ يُقَالُ لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٦٠</span>","End":"٦٠","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":61,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ فَأۡتُواْ بِهِۦ عَلَىٰٓ أَعۡيُنِ ٱلنَّاسِ لَعَلَّهُمۡ يَشۡهَدُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فَأْتُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> عَلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَعْيُنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَشْهَد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦١</span>","End":"٦١","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":62,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ ءَأَنتَ فَعَلۡتَ هَٰذَا بِـَٔالِهَتِنَا يَـٰٓإِبۡرَٰهِيمُ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> ءَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ فَعَلْتَ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا بِـَٔـالِهَتِنَا يَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>إِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٦٢</span>","End":"٦٢","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":63,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ بَلۡ فَعَلَهُۥ كَبِيرُهُمۡ هَٰذَا فَسۡـَٔلُوهُمۡ إِن كَانُواْ يَنطِقُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ بَلْ فَعَلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> كَبِيرُهُمْ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا فَسْــَٔلُوهُمْ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نط</tajweed>ِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٣</span>","End":"٦٣","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":64,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَرَجَعُوٓاْ إِلَىٰٓ أَنفُسِهِمۡ فَقَالُوٓاْ إِنَّكُمۡ أَنتُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","TajweedText":"فَرَجَع<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>ُسِهِمْ فَقَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٤</span>","End":"٦٤","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":65,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ثُمَّ نُكِسُواْ عَلَىٰ رُءُوسِهِمۡ لَقَدۡ عَلِمۡتَ مَا هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ يَنطِقُونَ","TajweedText":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ نُكِسُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَلَىٰ رُءُوسِهِمْ لَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> عَلِمْتَ مَا هَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ؤُل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نط</tajweed>ِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٥</span>","End":"٦٥","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":66,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ أَفَتَعۡبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا يَنفَعُكُمۡ شَيۡـٔٗا وَلَا يَضُرُّكُمۡ","TajweedText":"قَالَ أَفَتَعْبُدُونَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ مَا لَا يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>َعُكُمْ شَيْـ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ـًٔا و</tajweed>َلَا يَضُرُّكُمْ <span class=end>٦٦</span>","End":"٦٦","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":67,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أُفّٖ لَّكُمۡ وَلِمَا تَعۡبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِۚ أَفَلَا تَعۡقِلُونَ","TajweedText":"أُ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>فٍّ ل</tajweed>َّكُمْ وَلِمَا تَعْبُدُونَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ أَفَلَا تَعْقِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٧</span>","End":"٦٧","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":68,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ حَرِّقُوهُ وَٱنصُرُوٓاْ ءَالِهَتَكُمۡ إِن كُنتُمۡ فَٰعِلِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> حَرِّقُوهُ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نص</tajweed>ُر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> ءَالِهَتَكُمْ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ فَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>عِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٨</span>","End":"٦٨","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":69,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡنَا يَٰنَارُ كُونِي بَرۡدٗا وَسَلَٰمًا عَلَىٰٓ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ","TajweedText":"قُلْنَا يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَارُ كُونِى بَرْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>دًا و</tajweed>َسَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مًا عَلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مَ <span class=end>٦٩</span>","End":"٦٩","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":70,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَرَادُواْ بِهِۦ كَيۡدٗا فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُمُ ٱلۡأَخۡسَرِينَ","TajweedText":"وَأَرَادُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> كَيْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دًا ف</tajweed>َجَعَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخْسَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٠</span>","End":"٧٠","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":71,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَجَّيۡنَٰهُ وَلُوطًا إِلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ ٱلَّتِي بَٰرَكۡنَا فِيهَا لِلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"وَنَجَّيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ وَلُوطًا إِلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّتِى بَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رَكْنَا فِيهَا لِلْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧١</span>","End":"٧١","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":72,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَوَهَبۡنَا لَهُۥٓ إِسۡحَٰقَ وَيَعۡقُوبَ نَافِلَةٗۖ وَكُلّٗا جَعَلۡنَا صَٰلِحِينَ","TajweedText":"وَوَهَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَا لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِسْحَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قَ وَيَعْقُوبَ نَافِلَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً‌ۖ و</tajweed>َكُل<tajweed class=ikhafa>اًّ ج</tajweed>َعَلْنَا صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٢</span>","End":"٧٢","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}